      "storySections[_key==\"experience\"].title": "Focus on elevated user experience",
      "storySections[_key==\"experience\"].body": "When GE Digital, a newly formed division in GE, decided to consolidate their offices at Bangalore, they wanted the office to symbolize their vision and their journey forward.\n\nWe created a living office which is a high-performing workplace, that delivers an elevated experience of work for people and helps them achieve their strategic goals. One is free to decide the way they work and the place they work from. The office floor has different work environments from collaborative settings to individual spaces. The 20,000 SQM office space spread over 7 floors, with a capacity of 1500 plus employees has been designed to create a workplace that inculcates creativity and also promotes a fun & learning environment.",
      "storySections[_key==\"contrast\"].title": "Blend of contrasting aesthetics and systems",
      "storySections[_key==\"goals\"].title": "Designs that support strategic organizational goals",
